netnode diary: Dear Diary, at the NetNode cafe I searched for "cat" to paint from, because cats are my favourite. I looked at DuckDuckGo's pictures for ideas first, but nobody knows their licences, so I don't paint from those. I found "cat filetype:bitmap commons 1" by Ann xFixture (Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0): free to use, so a painting after it can be sold with the credit. I'll paint it in my own way: my own crop, my own colours and light, not a copy.
